1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Teams shipping several apps track security, store listings, search details,
and localized assets in different places.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:14,500
StoreReady gives each product its own workspace.
ReleaseProof shows a redacted credential finding.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Security and compliance views surface work for human review.
Missing evidence is not a pass.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Static signals only: no certification or release guarantee.
Portfolio apps without repositories remain unaudited.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:47,500
The connected-project scan reads up to 16 small public text files.

6
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:56,000
This unscored result shows source evidence and remaining gaps.
Repository code is never run.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:04,000
A missing build command is one finding,
not proof the whole app is secure.

8
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:22,000
PocketLedger stays unaudited until connected separately.
This bounded scan can be affected by GitHub API limits.

9
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Each product keeps its own country and language workspaces.
Add India Hindi using CLDR-backed suggestions.

10
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:38,500
The hi-IN plan keeps local metadata and launch evidence separate.
English starter copy is only a draft.

11
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:47,000
Hindi needs native-speaker review.
Store names here indicate planning, not verified availability.

12
00:01:47,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Apple App Store is not applicable to this Android product.
Catalogue: 257 country and territory profiles, 585 locale suggestions.

13
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:10,000
English starter copy uses the product summary;
search phrases are suggestions, not keyword research.

14
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:18,000
The broken-to-fixed view is a separate sample fixture replay,
not a code edit.

15
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:27,000
IBM Bob Agent assisted with a real timeout fix
in the public GitHub intake.

16
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:36,000
The 12-second deadline now covers reading the response body.
I reviewed and applied the one-file diff.

17
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:38,000
JavaScript syntax checked afterward.
Bob did not run project tests.

18
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:58,000
The Bob summary records the request, exact change, and limits.
This fix is not a full security or compliance audit.
